🖥️ Architettura degli Elaboratori 1

This folder contains notes, exercises, and resources for Computer Architecture 1, part of the first-year Computer Science curriculum.

Topics Covered

Number representation (binary, hexadecimal, two’s complement)

Boolean algebra and logic circuits

Combinational and sequential logic

CPU architecture and datapath

Instruction Set Architecture (ISA)

Memory hierarchy (cache, RAM, virtual memory)

Input/Output and bus systems

Basic assembly programming concepts

Usage

These notes are intended for personal study and revision.
Refer to the official course material and textbooks for complete accuracy.
